{"seq":3,"slug":"the-berkshire-path","title":"伯克希尔之路","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-partnership-years","title":"合伙公司岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/the-partnership-years","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"taking-over-berkshire","title":"接管伯克希尔","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/taking-over-berkshire","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 伯克希尔之路\n\n从投资合伙公司到接管伯克希尔，巴菲特一步步走向投资巨擘。本章追溯这条关键之路。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"合伙公司岁月\"——他如何以惊人回报证明价值投资的威力，积累第一桶巨额财富。第二篇文档讲述\"接管伯克希尔\",呈现他如何把一家衰败的纺织厂改造为庞大的投资控股帝国。\n"}